## The 3-Feature Demo That Will Impress Anyone

When presenting to a recruiter, investor, or professor, demo exactly these 3 things in this order:
1. **Paste a raw ChatGPT conversation → Graph appears in 10 seconds** (shows ingestion)
2. **Click a node → Provenance panel shows the exact source message** (shows trust)
3. **Search "why did we drop X" → Correct node surfaces instantly** (shows utility)

If those 3 flows work flawlessly, the project speaks for itself.
